BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//raspberrypi-magicmirror//demo calendar//DE
X-WR-CALNAME:Demo
X-DEMO-NOTE:Demo appointments for render.sh, served by mock-backend.js.
X-DEMO-NOTE:CATEGORIES picks the feed: personal, claude, sport or kultur (config.js).
X-DEMO-NOTE:Times are relative to the render, so the calendar is never empty:
X-DEMO-NOTE:  {now+90m}      90 minutes from now, on the quarter hour, kept within today
X-DEMO-NOTE:  {day+2 09:00}  the day after tomorrow at 09:00
X-DEMO-NOTE:  {day+13}       a date, for all-day events (DTSTART;VALUE=DATE)
BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:claude
SUMMARY:README aktualisieren
DTSTART:{now+30m}
DTEND:{now+60m}
END:VEVENT
